  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">S4-71 Water Missions International entreprenurial</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">S4-71 Water Missions International entrepren&#xf6;rsst&#xf6;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Vatten Missions International initiativ &quot;Empower&quot; (Empower =          solenergi laddning Mobiltelefoner) utnyttjar efterfr&#xe5;gan p&#xe5; telefon   laddning p&#xe5; landsbygden f&#xf6;r att subventionera kostnaderna i samband   med best&#xe5;ende vatten leverans av tj&#xe4;nster s&#xe5; att, genom att           tillhandah&#xe5;lla rent vatten och prisv&#xe4;rd telefon laddning, ekonomiska, sociala och fysiska (h&#xe4;lsa) transformation kan ske i fattiga samh&#xe4;lle</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Missions International&apos;s &quot;eMpower&quot; initiative (eMpower = solar  energy charging Mobile phones) utilizes demand for phone charging in  rural areas to subsidize the costs associated with lasting water      service delivery so that, through the provision of safe water and     affordable phone charging, economic, social and physical (health)     transformation can occur in impoverished communities.</narrative>
  </description>
